::  name       tally fold sumto gate
::  shape      n - int (@u32) -> sum - int (@u32)
::  invariant  folds 1..n into one @u32 while n stays within gardens=8; empty n=0 answers 0; past the wall answers 0
::  example    0 -> 0 · 3 -> 6 · 8 -> 36 · 9 -> 0
::  readers    Tally · Glow Tend a2 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-a2-tally-fold1-v0 · STOA332 landed: the lowerer speaks this body now (e243)
::
::  Ashvini a2 · gate one — the first Glow Tend gate that FOLDS.
::  a1 decided within a wall; this gate carries a small bounded value forward:
::  the triangular fold of the naturals up to n, asserted at the gardens wall.
|=  sample=@u32
|+  sumto  sample  8
